{"articles":[{"slug":"title3-45546","title":"title3","description":"description3","body":"Why is it that when one man builds a wall, the next man immediately needs to know what's on the other side?","tagList":["Start for Free"],"createdAt":"2026-02-11T17:51:08.572Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-11T17:51:08.572Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"title2-45546","title":"title2","description":"description2","body":"Power is a curious thing. Who lives, Who dies. Power resides where men believe it resides. It is a trick, A shadow on the wall.","tagList":["Start for Free"],"createdAt":"2026-02-11T17:51:05.609Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-11T17:51:05.609Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"title1-45546","title":"title1","description":"description1","body":"And I have a tender spot in my heart for cripples and bastards and broken things.","tagList":["Git"],"createdAt":"2026-02-11T17:51:04.488Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-11T17:51:04.488Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Yormwell-45546","title":"Yormwell","description":"Old Valyria","body":"The North remembers.","tagList":["Value-Focused"],"createdAt":"2026-02-11T16:14:56.387Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-11T16:14:56.387Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Lady-of-the-Leaves-45546","title":"Lady of the Leaves","description":"Mantarys","body":"... a mind needs books as a sword needs a whetstone, if it is to keep its edge.","tagList":["Start for Free"],"createdAt":"2026-02-11T15:39:47.461Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-11T15:39:47.461Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Roger-Hogg-45546","title":"Roger Hogg","description":"Pentos","body":"There are no heroes...in life, the monsters win.","tagList":["Test"],"createdAt":"2026-02-10T22:52:04.893Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-10T22:52:04.893Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Harren-Half-Hoare-45546","title":"Harren Half-Hoare","description":"Tyria","body":"Summer will end soon enough, and childhood as well.","tagList":["Test"],"createdAt":"2026-02-10T22:36:16.991Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-10T22:36:16.991Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Elder-Brother-45546","title":"Elder Brother","description":"Meereen","body":"A lion doesn't concern itself with the opinion of sheep.","tagList":["Git"],"createdAt":"2026-02-10T21:31:45.412Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-10T21:31:45.412Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Martyn-Rivers-45546","title":"Martyn Rivers","description":"Lannisport","body":"Every flight begins with a fall.","tagList":["Git"],"createdAt":"2026-02-07T04:49:46.514Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-07T04:49:46.514Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Brandon-Norrey-45546","title":"Brandon Norrey","description":"White Harbor","body":"And so he spoke, and so he spoke, that Lord of Castamere, but now the rains weep o'er his hall, with no one there to hear. Yes, now the rains weep o'er his hall, and not a soul to hear.","tagList":["Value-Focused"],"createdAt":"2026-02-07T04:48:25.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-07T04:48:25.386Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}}],"articlesCount":41}

