es/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Harren-Half-Hoare-45546","title":"Harren Half-Hoare","description":"Tyria","body":"Summer will end soon enough, and childhood as well.","tagList":["Test"],"createdAt":"2026-02-10T22:36:16.991Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-10T22:36:16.991Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Elder-Brother-45546","title":"Elder Brother","description":"Meereen","body":"A lion doesn't concern itself with the opinion of sheep.","tagList":["Git"],"createdAt":"2026-02-10T21:31:45.412Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-10T21:31:45.412Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Martyn-Rivers-45546","title":"Martyn Rivers","description":"Lannisport","body":"Every flight begins with a fall.","tagList":["Git"],"createdAt":"2026-02-07T04:49:46.514Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-07T04:49:46.514Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Brandon-Norrey-45546","title":"Brandon Norrey","description":"White Harbor","body":"And so he spoke, and so he spoke, that Lord of Castamere, but now the rains weep o'er his hall, with no one there to hear. Yes, now the rains weep o'er his hall, and not a soul to hear.","tagList":["Value-Focused"],"createdAt":"2026-02-07T04:48:25.386Z","updatedAt":"2026-02-07T04:48:25.386Z","favorited":false,"favoritesCount":0,"author":{"username":"Osva","bio":null,"image":"https://conduit-api.bondaracademy.com/images/smiley-cyrus.jpeg","following":false}},{"slug":"Eroeh-45546","title":"Eroeh","description":"Astapor","body":"Why is it that when one man builds a wall, the next man immediately needs to know what's on the other side?","tagList":["Test